  "milestone": "{id, select, m2_social{Smiles when you talk to or smile at them} m2_language{Makes sounds other than crying} m2_cognitive{Watches you as you move} m2_movement{Holds head up when on tummy} m4_social{Smiles on their own to get your attention} m4_language{Makes cooing sounds like \"oooo\" and \"aahh\"} m4_cognitive{Looks at their hands with interest} m4_movement{Holds head steady without support when you hold them} m6_social{Knows familiar people} m6_language{Takes turns making sounds with you} m6_cognitive{Reaches to grab a toy they want} m6_movement{Rolls from tummy to back} m9_social{Looks when you call their name} m9_language{Makes sounds like \"mamama\" and \"bababa\"} m9_cognitive{Looks for things when you drop them out of sight} m9_movement{Sits without support} m12_social{Plays games with you, like pat-a-cake} m12_language{Waves \"bye-bye\"} m12_cognitive{Looks for things they see you hide} m12_movement{Pulls up to stand} m15_social{Shows you an object they like} m15_language{Tries to say one or two words besides \"mama\" or \"dada\"} m15_cognitive{Stacks at least two small objects} m15_movement{Takes a few steps on their own} m18_social{Points to show you something interesting} m18_language{Tries to say three or more words besides \"mama\" or \"dada\"} m18_cognitive{Copies you doing chores, like sweeping} m18_movement{Walks without holding on to anyone or anything} m24_social{Notices when others are hurt or upset} m24_language{Says at least two words together, like \"more milk\"} m24_cognitive{Tries to use switches, knobs or buttons on a toy} m24_movement{Kicks a ball} m30_social{Plays next to other children and sometimes with them} m30_language{Says about 50 words} m30_cognitive{Uses things to pretend, like feeding a doll} m30_movement{Jumps off the ground with both feet} m36_social{Notices other children and joins them to play} m36_language{Holds a conversation with you of at least two back-and-forth exchanges} m36_cognitive{Draws a circle when you show them how} m36_movement{Puts on some clothes by themselves} m48_social{Comforts others who are hurt or sad} m48_language{Says sentences with four or more words} m48_cognitive{Names a few colours} m48_movement{Catches a large ball most of the time} m60_social{Follows rules or takes turns when playing games} m60_language{Tells a story they heard or made up, with at least two events} m60_cognitive{Counts to 10} m60_movement{Hops on one foot} other{}}",
